==Strategy==
The level is much easier with some [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-red cats]], but don't focus entirely on them - the Bores in this level are only at 100% strength magnification. Almost all of the anti-red cats you bring along will be outranged by Camelle, if not by Madam the Savannah herself.

[[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] will lower Bore's pushing power. If you have the true form, a couple [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]] will make short work of Bore whenever he shows up.

Attackers with over 300 range (namely [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] Dragon) can take out the Madam. When she falls, Camelle can be easily wrecked by your horde.

